 "policy": [
  "Each Lorcana promo prints its own footer (number/P1-P4, DIS, PD1 or RPH), so one footer is one printing. TCGplayer files each as its own product; this file follows that convention.",
  "stamp is null when the printed footer alone distinguishes the printing. Lorcana promos print their own promo number rather than an event stamp.",
  "finishes maps each publisher finish pattern to the TCGplayer price lanes reviewed for the distribution. TCGplayer labels single-foil promos Cold Foil or Holofoil inconsistently across releases, so rules split by printed set where the label changes.",
  "physicalReleaseEvidence is the publisher card gallery, which lists every selected card with its printed footer and finish (checked by audit_catalog_coverage.py --lorcana-publisher-gallery).",
  "expectedCount pins the cards a rule selects; expectedProducts (default expectedCount) pins the TCGplayer products it matches. A new card or product is drift that needs a reviewed edit here.",
  "holds lists every selected card that cannot be reconciled, with its reason. The reconciler refuses to write when its holds differ from this list.",
  "Edge cases follow what collectors and the main references do. Where they genuinely disagree, the catalog gives the user more choice, but never shows a guess as fact or a price that belongs to another card."
 ],
