   "rationale": "Two printings. The publisher gallery lists Moana (culture_invariant_id 1433) and Vaiana (1663) as separate English cards with their own card image (promo2_26 and promo2_26vaiana), name and flavor text, under the same footer. Vaiana is the title used in several European countries for the Moana 2 cinema giveaway. A collector can tell the two apart at a glance. TCGplayer lists only Moana (product 601112), so Moana keeps that price and Vaiana is \"Not yet priced\": the Moana price is never shown for Vaiana. The shared footer opens a printing choice at scan time.",
   "sources": [
    "https://cards.disneylorcana.com/en-US/",
    "https://lorcanaplayer.com/franchise/moana",
    "https://www.brandsuntapped.com/ravensburger-and-odeon-ready-disney-lorcana-promo-card-for-moana-2/"
   ]
  }
 ],
